  "id": "spiced-turnips",
  "name": "Spiced Turnips",
  "subtitle": "Tender turnips in a warmly seasoned tomato masala",
  "description": "Turnips simmer with onion, chile, aromatic spices, and tomato, then finish with a touch of brown sugar for balanced flavor.",
